   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the executive law, in relation to including White Lake in the\ncounty of Sullivan as an inland waterway for the purposes of waterfront\nrevitalization",
    "basePrintNo": "S7902",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7902-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §911, Exec L",
    "lawSection": "Executive Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S7902\n\nSPONSOR: MARTUCCI\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the executive law, in relation to including White Lake\nin the county of Sullivan as an inland waterway for the purposes of\nwaterfront revitalization\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis bill designates White Lake in Sullivan County as inland waterway\nfor the purpose of waterfront revitalization.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends paragraph (a) of subdivision 4 of section 911 of the\nexecutive law to expand the definition of \"inland waterways\" to include\nWhite Lake.\n\nSection 2 establishes the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nAllowing White Lake to be designated as inland waterway offers the\nlocality the opportunity to address the needs of their local waterbody.\nBy becoming inland waterway, White Lake will be eligible to apply for\nfunding through the Department of State and Environmental Protection\nFund to improve the.quality of the lakes.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
